# R362: every node:test file in scripts/test/ compiles into a throwaway
# `tmp-*-tsc/` (or `tmp-rNNN*/`) directory next to the package root. Most
# of them never clean up, so a full `npm test` leaves ~80 untracked dirs
# that bury real changes in `git status`. Ignore the whole shape rather
# than playing whack-a-mole with each test's naming scheme.
tmp-*-tsc/
tmp-*-tsc2/
tmp-r362/
tmp-r362-view/
tmp-r196-cmds-tsc/
tmp-r456-e2e/
tmp-test/
tmp-test-r86/
tmp-test-r91d/
tmp-test-r94e/
tmp-test-r112/
tmp-r49-tsc/
tmp-r56-tsc2/
tmp-r42-tsc2/
tmp-r41-tsc2/
tmp-r43-tsc2/
tmp-r47-tsc2/
tmp-r48-tsc2/
tmp-r50-tsc2/
tmp-r51-tsc2/
tmp-r77-tsc/
dist/
node_modules/

# R363: test shims written into src/ by node:test suites. Fifteen suites
# (t433, t457, t6-09..t6-17, t7-03, t7-06, t7-12, t7-14, r169, r196-*)
# drop a `_...` re-export file next to the component they exercise and
# delete it when they finish. That is a race with the full-project
# `tsc --noEmit` in phase-7-t7-10.test.mjs, which globs src/ — hence the
# matching `exclude` in tsconfig.json. Ignore the whole `_` shape rather
# than whack-a-mole with each suite's filename.
src/**/_*.ts
src/**/_*.tsx

# R363: the throwaway compile dirs the shim suites now use (the shims
# moved out of src/ so they can't race the full-project compile).
tmp-r196-notif-tsc/
